        <mxCell id="box_validation_state" parent="1" style="shape=rect;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;strokeColor=#003366;fillColor=#f0f4f8;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:8px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Validation &amp;amp; Recovery State&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:6px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;width:100%;font-size:10px;color:#000000;&quot; cellpadding=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:45%;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;State Description:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Triggered upon invalid submission (e.g., Amount = -5.0 km). Highlights the invalid Amount field in red, displays inline plain-language error notice (&lt;b&gt;&amp;quot;ValueError: Amount must be positive&amp;quot;&lt;/b&gt;), and preserves validly entered pending inputs (Date = 2026-08-15, Note = &amp;apos;Morning walk&amp;apos;) intact.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:55%;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Design Decisions &amp;amp; Annotations:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:4px 0;padding-left:16px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Decision 1:&lt;/b&gt; Invalid Amount field highlighted red with inline feedback &amp;quot;ValueError: Amount must be positive&amp;quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;Requirement FB-04; PO2 Exception Path | &lt;b&gt;Req:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;U3&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Decision 2:&lt;/b&gt; Retains valid pending fields (date = 2026-08-15, note = Morning walk) upon validation retry.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;Requirement FB-04; Mobile Interruption Context | &lt;b&gt;Req:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;U5&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="1000" x="50" y="395" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_confirmation_state" parent="1" style="shape=rect;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;strokeColor=#003366;fillColor=#f0f4f8;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:8px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Confirmation State&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:6px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;width:100%;font-size:10px;color:#000000;&quot; cellpadding=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:45%;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;State Description:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Displayed upon successful persistence. Shows explicit saved &lt;b&gt;ActivityRecord&lt;/b&gt; card (&lt;b&gt;Distinct Step 1: Persistence&lt;/b&gt; - Record ID: ACT-104, Amount: 3.5 km, Date: 2026-08-15) alongside dynamically recalculated &lt;b&gt;ProgressSummary&lt;/b&gt; metrics (&lt;b&gt;Distinct Step 2: Progress Calculation&lt;/b&gt; - Total Logged: 3.5 / 20.0 km, Completion: 17.5%, Status: ACTIVE).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:55%;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Design Decisions &amp;amp; Annotations:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:4px 0;padding-left:16px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Decision:&lt;/b&gt; Renders saved ActivityRecord details alongside recalculated ProgressSummary.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Requirements FB-02, FB-05, FB-07&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Requirement:&lt;/b&gt; U4 (State Confirmation &amp;amp; Progress)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rationale:&lt;/b&gt; Immediate verification that disk save succeeded and progress was calculated as distinct sequential operations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="1000" x="50" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_annotations_summary" parent="1" style="shape=rect;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;strokeColor=#003366;fillColor=#f0f4f8;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:8px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Annotations Table&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:6px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:9px;color:#000000;&quot; cellpadding=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background-color:#dae8fc;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;width:15%;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Interface State&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;width:28%;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Design Decision &amp;amp; Annotation&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;width:20%;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Supporting Evidence&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;width:12%;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Traceability Requirement&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;width:25%;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Design Rationale &amp;amp; Risk Mitigation&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Entry State&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Direct &amp;quot;Record Activity&amp;quot; action button placed directly on active challenge card.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;UC-05 Step 1; Act 1 Task Risk Step 1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;U1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Enables rapid discovery (&amp;le; 3s) for outdoor mobile users without deep navigation friction.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Form State&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Header displays Walk 20K, walk, and explicit km unit label beside amount input.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;C001 Spec (goal_unit=&#39;km&#39;); Act 1 Unit Risk&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;U2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Prevents measurement unit ambiguity under outdoor screen glare.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Validation state&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Invalid Amount field highlighted red with inline feedback &amp;quot;ValueError: Amount must be positive&amp;quot;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Requirement FB-04; PO2 Exception Path&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;U3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Renders immediate plain-language feedback (&amp;lt; 1s) without generic modal popups.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Recovery State&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Retains valid pending fields (date = 2026-08-15, note = Morning walk) upon validation retry.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Requirement FB-04; Mobile Interruption Context&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;U5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Eliminates frustrating data loss, ensuring zero re-typing of valid inputs during error recovery.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Confirmation State&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Renders saved ActivityRecord details (Distinct Step 1: Persistence) alongside recalculated ProgressSummary (Distinct Step 2: Progress Calculation).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Requirements FB-02, FB-05, FB-07&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;U4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Provides immediate verification that disk save succeeded and progress was calculated from stored records as distinct sequential operations.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="310" width="1000" x="50" y="765" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
