        <mxCell id="p4a" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf2fb;strokeColor=#1f5fae;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Candidate inventory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Current System Controller&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;code&gt;ChallengeManager&lt;/code&gt; (coordinates validation, persistence, and dynamic progress calculation).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Current Domain Classes&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;code&gt;Participant&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Challenge&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Enrollment&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ActivityRecord&lt;/code&gt; (retained domain models representing core application entities).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Current Implementation Module&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;code&gt;storage&lt;/code&gt; (implementation file utility; excluded from domain class hierarchy).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Proposed Boundary Hypothesis&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;code&gt;«boundary hypothesis» RecordActivityUI&lt;/code&gt; (unifies form input, inline validation messaging, and confirmation).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rejected Candidates&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:.5in&quot;&gt;SubmitButton (Rejected): UI action widget inside the interface; not a software entity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:.5in&quot;&gt;AmountField (Rejected): UI input widget; captures numeric data but belongs inside the boundary abstraction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:.5in&quot;&gt;DateInputPicker (Rejected): Visual input selector; internal implementation detail of RecordActivityUI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:.5in&quot;&gt;ValidationNotifier (Rejected): Ephemeral view feedback element; handled by RecordActivityUI.showFieldError().&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:.5in&quot;&gt;ProgressSummary (Rejected): Derived calculation dictionary returned by ChallengeManager.progress(), not a persistent entity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:.5in&quot;&gt;ActivityStorageAdapter (Rejected): Unnecessary architectural layer; persistent file I/O is already managed by challengehub/storage.py.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
